<title>FRANCE: Dassault-Aerospatiale merger on Jan 1 97.</title>
<headline>Dassault-Aerospatiale merger on Jan 1 97.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The merger between Aerospatiale and Dassault Aviation &quot;will be effective on January 1, 1997&quot;, French Defence Minister Charles Millon said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;The negotiations between Dassault and Aerospatiale are progressing,&quot; he added, speaking in a radio interview. &quot;A good marriage is a marriage in which you discuss everything before the marriage contract rather than realising the problems after the contract.&quot;</p>
<p>The planned merger of the two companies is aimed at creating a single large air and defence company in France that could compete more effectively on the international scene.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
